{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>iPhone Duo 今日在香港開售，開售前有人樂觀預期先達回收價可高出官方售價約 HK$5,000。實際上，早上最高「只賺」約 HK$3,700，中午回落至約 HK$2,800，到下午 3 時再跌至約 HK$2,600。目前賺幅最高的是夜空色 256GB。</p>\n<img alt=\"單手握持的 iPhone Duo 外螢幕顯示主畫面。\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/iphone-duo-scalp-02.jpg\">\n<h2>最新先達回收價</h2>\n<p>以下為 iPhonePriceHK 2026 年 10 月 23 日 15:00 的先達報價，並列出每部相對官方售價的賺幅。</p>\n<p>Apple 香港列出的 iPhone Duo 官方售價分別為 256GB HK$17,499、512GB HK$19,299、1TB HK$22,799 及 2TB HK$27,999，提供夜空色及星光白色。</p>\n<img alt=\"多部不同角度的 iPhone Duo，展示外螢幕與內螢幕。\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/iphone-duo-scalp-21.jpg\">\n<table>\n<row span=\"4\">\n<cell>容量</cell>\n<cell>官方售價</cell>\n<cell>夜空色回收價（賺幅）</cell>\n<cell>星光白色回收價（賺幅）</cell>\n</row>\n<row span=\"4\">\n<cell>256GB</cell>\n<cell>HK$17,499</cell>\n<cell>HK$20,100（+HK$2,601）</cell>\n<cell>HK$19,200（+HK$1,701）</cell>\n</row>\n<row span=\"4\">\n<cell>512GB</cell>\n<cell>HK$19,299</cell>\n<cell>HK$21,500（+HK$2,201）</cell>\n<cell>HK$20,500（+HK$1,201）</cell>\n</row>\n<row span=\"4\">\n<cell>1TB</cell>\n<cell>HK$22,799</cell>\n<cell>HK$24,800（+HK$2,001）</cell>\n<cell>HK$24,500（+HK$1,701）</cell>\n</row>\n<row>\n<cell>2TB</cell>\n<cell>HK$27,999</cell>\n<cell>HK$29,700（+HK$1,701）</cell>\n<cell>HK$29,600（+HK$1,601）</cell>\n</row>\n</table>\n<img alt=\"白色 iPhone Duo 摺合後展示鏡頭模組及內螢幕。\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/iphone-duo-scalp-29.jpg\">\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:44:39.827973+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":564,"images":3,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T09:19:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T02:38:47.139501+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:39:00.755268+00:00","content_hash":"6a82fe017ad40940fab570c2bd0e55455de119fd0b4e870fef2fea6e36a42719","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}